    smtg:stepsDescription "At the beginning of each upkeep, Tombostone Stairwell's first ability triggers, causing each player to create a 2/2 Zombie creature token for each creature card in their graveyard.\nAt the beginning of each end step, Tombstone Stairwell's second ability triggers, destroying all tokens created by it.\nWhen the token(s) die, Blood Artist triggers that many times, causing an opponent to lose that much life and you to gain that much life.\nRepeat during each turn.";
    smtg:comboColorIdentity <https://w3id.org/smtg/vocab/color-combination/B>.
