    smtg:stepsDescription "Activate Warren Soultrader by paying 1 life and sacrificing a creature.\nWhen the creature dies, Blood Artist triggers, causing you to gain 1 life and an opponent to lose 1 life.\nResolve the Warren Soultrader ability, creating a Treasure token.\nActivate Stimulus Package by sacrificing the Treasure, creating a 1/1 Citizen creature token.\nRepeat.";
    smtg:notablePrerequisites "You control an additional creature.\nYour life total is at least 2.";
    smtg:comboColorIdentity <https://w3id.org/smtg/vocab/color-combination/BRG>.
